{"4119820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mutiny's Wake", "steam_appid": 4119820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Exclusive Early Access Rewards</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for at least 3 hours during the Early Access phase to earn exclusive Steam Inventory items:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Founder's Coin (untradeable): gives your in-game name a golden color.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Coats (tradeable): allows unlocking their crafting blueprints using SP.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These item drops will end when the game leaves Early Access!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutiny’s Wake is a survival game set during the Golden Age of Piracy, where a mutiny leaves survivors stranded on a hostile island with limited resources and constant danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship crashes, you wash ashore with nothing. The island is occupied by pirates fighting over what little remains. Resources do not respawn, every decision matters, and survival depends on planning, awareness, and knowing when to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, hunt, build a base, and craft tools, weapons, clothing, traps and ships. Hide from pirates or kill them to steal their resources. Wildlife is just as dangerous, with cougars and panthers roaming the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island holds dangerous locations and rare opportunities. A sealed cave hides valuable resources and deadly threats. Wrecks, docks, and taverns controlled by pirates offer supplies, if you survive long enough to take them. A heavily armed ship occasionally patrols the waters, threatening player vessels but rewarding those who manage to sink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with others in peer-to-peer multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is blueprint-based, with crafting blueprints unlocked through levelling, allowing you to specialize your approach to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore survival with limited non-respawning resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP and PvE on a shared pirate-controlled island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building and raiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system for tools, structures, weapons, clothing, traps, ships, and cannons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk locations and events with valuable rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and multiplayer gameplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutiny’s Wake is a survival game set during the Golden Age of Piracy, where a mutiny leaves survivors stranded on a hostile island with limited resources and constant danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship crashes, you wash ashore with nothing. The island is occupied by pirates fighting over what little remains. Resources do not respawn, every decision matters, and survival depends on planning, awareness, and knowing when to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, hunt, build a base, and craft tools, weapons, clothing, traps and ships. Hide from pirates or kill them to steal their resources. Wildlife is just as dangerous, with cougars and panthers roaming the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island holds dangerous locations and rare opportunities. A sealed cave hides valuable resources and deadly threats. Wrecks, docks, and taverns controlled by pirates offer supplies, if you survive long enough to take them. A heavily armed ship occasionally patrols the waters, threatening player vessels but rewarding those who manage to sink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with others in peer-to-peer multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is blueprint-based, with crafting blueprints unlocked through levelling, allowing you to specialize your approach to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore survival with limited non-respawning resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP and PvE on a shared pirate-controlled island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building and raiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system for tools, structures, weapons, clothing, traps, ships, and cannons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk locations and events with valuable rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and multiplayer gameplay</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A hardcore pirate survival game set during the Golden Age of Piracy. Stranded on a hostile island after a mutiny, you must scavenge, hunt, craft, and survive against pirates, wildlife, and dwindling resources.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Outlive the competition whose settlements you will attack and plunder, just as they will yours.”<br>BUG HR<br><br>“A true survival title - start from scratch to build a base and ships, gather resources, and prepare for battle with other players.”<br>IGN<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119820/35ce6282501bf71a44d78d0e35dcfa507564c669/header.jpg?t=1778774420", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119820/ada460c5971ef0cd9ff514f07b4ba1e614112038/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778774420", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119820/ada460c5971ef0cd9ff514f07b4ba1e614112038/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778774420", "website": null, 